OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper accused of              
OL,4,A'environmental vandalism'              
OL,6,FWork to gain access to land for a      
OL,7,Fhousing development and a new "super   
OL,8,Fcycleway" has resulted in              
OL,9,F"environmental vandalism", councillors 
OL,10,Fhave said.                             
OL,12,FKidlington Green councillors Ian       
OL,13,FMiddleton and Fiona Mawson said        
OL,14,Fresidents were concerned by the number 
OL,15,Fof hedgerows and trees recently cut    
OL,16,Fdown on Oxford Road.                   
OL,18,FAdjacent fields have planning          
OL,19,Fpermission for 800 homes as part of    
OL,20,Fwider plans for more than 4,400 to be  
OL,21,Fbuilt in the area.                     
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
